## 🔧 Requirements

### For v0.0.9 (Stable)
- Python >= 3.11
- uvicorn >= 0.30.0

### For v0.1.0-alpha (Development)
- Python >= 3.14
- uvicorn >= 0.30.0

### Optional Dependencies
- **Admin Panel**: `pip install kardocore[admin]`
- **Full CMS**: `pip install kardocore[full]`
- **AI Features**: `pip install kardocore[ai]`
- **All Features**: `pip install kardocore[all]`

